{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CevHybb9XzLW8Cwko2sDt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests passed. The test results show:\n- **Total tests**: 17 tests ran\n- **For ShipmentControllerTest specifically**: 9 tests (5 original + 4 new)\n- **Failures**: 0\n- **Errors**: 0\n- **BUILD SUCCESS**\n\nThe verification command completed successfully with no failures.\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** — `./mvnw test` returned BUILD SUCCESS with all 17 tests passing\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** — The 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests plus all other test classes pass\n3. ✅ **`POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` confirms a created shipment and persists it** — Test \"confirms a created shipment\" verifies CREATED → CONFIRMED transition and response with updated status\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** — Uses existing `ConflictException` (409) and `ResourceNotFoundException` (404) patterns with error codes in ApiError envelope\n5. ✅ **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused** — Three separate tests cover idempotency, cancellation rejection, and missing shipment\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency appears** — No changes to pom.xml\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** — Only changed ShipmentController and ApiError (both directly required)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n- **ApiError.kt**: Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` to ErrorCode enum — necessary to distinguish between resource-not-found (404) and invalid-state (409)\n- **ShipmentController.kt**: Added `confirm` endpoint with proper status code handling (200 for success, 404 for not found, 409 for invalid state) — this is the core requirement\n- **ShipmentControllerTest.kt**: Added 4 tests covering CREATED→CONFIRMED, idempotency, cancellation rejection, and missing resource — necessary to verify